This repository contains code derived from dbt-denodo 1.0.0, the dbt adapter
for Denodo published on PyPI (https://pypi.org/project/dbt-denodo/):

    Copyright (c) 2026, denodo technologies (http://www.denodo.com)
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
    Part of the DenodoConnect component collection.

Two macros in macros/_adapter__denodo.sql are modified versions of macros of
that adapter and keep their names, so that dbt uses them in their place:

    denodo__get_catalog     reads GET_VIEW_COLUMNS() joined to GET_VIEWS() and
                            filters on the output column database_name
    denodo__create_folder   creates every level of a nested folder path

Everything else in this repository is original work. Nothing from the adapter
package itself, and no Denodo driver or binary, is redistributed here.
